<title>GREECE: GENER SETS UP TELECARD IN BOSNIA.</title>
<headline>GENER SETS UP TELECARD IN BOSNIA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gener said it set up a joint venture company -- Telecard -- along with Serbia's Cajavec and Kraina's PTT telecom, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Telecard will establish a network of Intracom made cardphones in Bosnia. Some 250 such cardphones will be operational this year,&quot; it said, adding that the project is budgeted at $1.0 million.</p>
<p>Shares of Gener eased 10 drachmas to close at 1,215 in light volume. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
